    description: "Application log samples with raw multiline content."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "{\n  application: \"networks\"\n  log_format: \"structured\"\n  # Example stack trace\n  sample_error: \"\"\"\nError: We need to compress the back-end RSS bus!\n    at /usr/fooey_than.3gp:219\n    at /usr/src/outlaw_fooey_correctly.js:469\n    at process.main (node:internal/main:1:1)\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Sample HTTP request\n  sample_request: \"\"\"\nPOST /api/sprinkles HTTP/1.1\nHost: upbeat-interior.org\nUser-Agent: Googlebot/2.1 (+http://www.google.com/bot.html)\nAccept: application/json\n\"\"\"\n  retention_days: 34\n}"
