    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Talio aedificium sit cunae solium verumtamen sol amicitia.\"\n  slug: \"tutis-vehemens-cuius\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Miss Olin Mraz\"\n    avatar: \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/faker-js/assets-person-portrait/male/512/79.jpg\"\n    bio: \"giggle junkie, activist 🦊\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-04-06\"\n  tags: [\n    \"produce\"\n    \"bug\"\n    \"sanity\"\n  ]\n\n  published: true\n  reading_time: \"20 min\"\n  summary: \"Terga urbs amplus theca viriliter vulticulus. Quod confugo tergiversatio dens aperio synagoga at argentum tero. Natus ademptio quis ambulo cariosus aqua voco desipio bellum virga.\"\n}"
