  {
    num: "3668"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Dhansak-rubbed Turkey Salad\"\n  servings: 3\n  prep_time: \"10 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"102 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 oz juniper berries\"\n    \"2 pieces shiitake mushrooms\"\n    \"4 tsp arugula\"\n    \"3 lbs kokam\"\n    \"1 tsp nuts\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Hearty farmed prawns and lamb stew, slow-cooked with sweet laurel and kale for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"Our sour pork, slow-cooked to perfection, accompanied by steamed garlic and a rich, savory gravy.\"\n    \"An exquisite quail roast, infused with the essence of tangelo, slow-roasted to bring out its natural flavors and served with a side of creamy eggplant\"\n    \"Three bamboo shoots with asparagus, chinese cabbage, celery, endive and kohlrabi. With a side of baked corella pear, and your choice of yellow papaw or eggs.\"\n    \"A salty bean shoots creation, seasoned with mustard and ras-el-hanout, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"Grilled emu kebabs, marinated in Taiwanese spices and served with a fresh kale and papaw salad.\"\n    \"An exquisite salmon roast, infused with the essence of lime, slow-roasted to bring out its natural flavors and served with a side of creamy carrot\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 565\n    protein: \"49g\"\n    carbs: \"67g\"\n    fat: \"18g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "3669"
