    description: "A blog post with metadata and content sections."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Tergum celer suasoria tabernus.\"\n  slug: \"demum-cenaculum-acies\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Rosanna Cassin Jr.\"\n    avatar: \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/689343\"\n    bio: \"linseed junkie, veteran 🐟\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-04-04\"\n  tags: [\n    \"papa\"\n    \"whack\"\n    \"government\"\n  ]\n\n  published: false\n  reading_time: \"9 min\"\n  summary: \"Contra aurum vaco tamen tergum aiunt conturbo. Non caveo currus colligo. Vigilo certe cultura dignissimos verumtamen.\"\n}"
